(7612523, 1231875, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is dark and mysterious .. and a bit like a horror story .. even without the title .. looks like a lot of stuff goes on here .. nefarious is the word that comes to mind .. of course i''m loving the black and white and the barren dilapidated feel .. this is unusual .. !! .. :)</td>', 'this is dark and mysterious .. and a bit like a horror story .. even without the title .. looks like a lot of stuff goes on here .. nefarious is the word that comes to mind .. of course i''m loving the black and white and the barren dilapidated feel .. this is unusual .. !! .. :)', '2019-02-07 05:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7612524, 1231914, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant catch .. you must be almost psychic .. being at the right place at the right time .. as the bird flying past is magic .. <br/>and i''m loving your title .. it applies not only to the boatmen but the bird as well .. great bnw edit .. this feels like it was taken by a film camera .. has an old feel to it ..</td>', 'brilliant catch .. you must be almost psychic .. being at the right place at the right time .. as the bird flying past is magic .. and i''m loving your title .. it applies not only to the boatmen but the bird as well .. great bnw edit .. this feels like it was taken by a film camera .. has an old feel to it ..', '2019-02-07 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
