(7612702, 1231914, 67145, '<td valign="top">im beginning to feel biased when I see your photos in a challenge .. as it''s often quite easy to tell which are your entries .. you have a very unique style ..<br/>anyway .. I reiterate what I said during voting .. and I won''t let recognition stop me voting what I feel your images are worth .. ..and that''s usually a lot .. :)</td>', 'im beginning to feel biased when I see your photos in a challenge .. as it''s often quite easy to tell which are your entries .. you have a very unique style ..anyway .. I reiterate what I said during voting .. and I won''t let recognition stop me voting what I feel your images are worth .. ..and that''s usually a lot .. :)', '2019-02-08 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612703, 1231875, 30861, '<td valign="top">Jaysus, and to think I gave this a 10! Obviously the crowd and I are a pole and a half apart on this. wonderful image.</td>', 'Jaysus, and to think I gave this a 10! Obviously the crowd and I are a pole and a half apart on this. wonderful image.', '2019-02-08 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612708, 1231825, 112739, '<td valign="top">Told you it would take the blue! Congrats  Rob!</td>', 'Told you it would take the blue! Congrats  Rob!', '2019-02-08 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612739, 1231914, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks like your favourite holiday destination.</td>', 'Looks like your favourite holiday destination.', '2019-02-08 02:33:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612740, 1231825, 109387, '<td valign="top">No doubt it was going to win, it''s a super shot! I''m quite sure it''s the first time with a drone podium.<br/> <br/>Can''t wait to go and shoot together in the desert man! :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on your well deserved blue.</td>', 'No doubt it was going to win, it''s a super shot! I''m quite sure it''s the first time with a drone podium. Can''t wait to go and shoot together in the desert man! :) Congrats on your well deserved blue.', '2019-02-08 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612742, 1231952, 135744, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot Mark - congrats! I thought the laws on drones prohibited using a drone in areas with lots of people. Are you being naughty or are the rules were you live pretty lapse?</td>', 'Amazing shot Mark - congrats! I thought the laws on drones prohibited using a drone in areas with lots of people. Are you being naughty or are the rules were you live pretty lapse?', '2019-02-08 04:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612744, 1231952, 109387, '<td valign="top">Great, super perspective! You are the king of trains ^____^<br/> <br/>Congrats on your well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Great, super perspective! You are the king of trains ^____^ Congrats on your well deserved ribbon.', '2019-02-08 04:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612745, 1231889, 114285, '<td valign="top">THe drones have it!! Amazing shot Alex.</td>', 'THe drones have it!! Amazing shot Alex.', '2019-02-08 04:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612746, 1231952, 114285, '<td valign="top">You''ve drone it again :)<br/> <br/>Congrats, mighty fine shot.</td>', 'You''ve drone it again :) Congrats, mighty fine shot.', '2019-02-08 04:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612755, 1231594, 115664, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the lovely comments. It really was an amazing experience. We did Falkland Islands, South Georgia and Antarctica. The brown penguins are juvenile Kings! Sailors who first saw them thought they were a separate species and called them Oakum Boys!<br/>Go see it all before it is gone!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the lovely comments. It really was an amazing experience. We did Falkland Islands, South Georgia and Antarctica. The brown penguins are juvenile Kings! Sailors who first saw them thought they were a separate species and called them Oakum Boys!Go see it all before it is gone!', '2019-02-08 05:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612763, 1231825, 109227, '<td valign="top">There you go Rob, no doubt; fabulous shot. Congrats on the blue ribbon.</td>', 'There you go Rob, no doubt; fabulous shot. Congrats on the blue ribbon.', '2019-02-08 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612764, 1231883, 173844, '<td valign="top">My only 10, this charged (no pun intended -- really) image is a communion between dimensions, a mysterious ritual highlighted by the central black stripe.  The composition is nuanced and cunning, vertical thirds, each of which offers an aspect of this moment in time.  In a further stroke the bottom third serves as a unifying anchor.  We can''t know what she sees as she looks outside the mirror.  It''s quiet and concentrated.  It''s beautifully balanced in tone and emotion.  So much more than satisfying, it''s a stunning triumph.</td>', 'My only 10, this charged (no pun intended -- really) image is a communion between dimensions, a mysterious ritual highlighted by the central black stripe.  The composition is nuanced and cunning, vertical thirds, each of which offers an aspect of this moment in time.  In a further stroke the bottom third serves as a unifying anchor.  We can''t know what she sees as she looks outside the mirror.  It''s quiet and concentrated.  It''s beautifully balanced in tone and emotion.  So much more than satisfying, it''s a stunning triumph.', '2019-02-08 08:14:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612765, 1231952, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wtg Mark, fantastic shot.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Wtg Mark, fantastic shot.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2019-02-08 08:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612767, 1231889, 109227, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'A beautiful image, congrats on the ribbon.', '2019-02-08 08:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7612774, 1231825, 38032, '<td valign="top">truly incredible.</td>', 'truly incredible.', '2019-02-08 09:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
